WEBVTT

00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:31.988
Unavyojua,
tumeishi New York City tangu 2015

00:00:32.385 --> 00:00:35.734
Lakini maisha yamebadilika mno 
kwa mwaka uliopita.

00:00:36.243 --> 00:00:39.561
Hapo mwanzoni, New York 
ilikua ni sehemu ya makumbusho

00:00:39.585 --> 00:00:40.783
na hifadhi

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.487
na shule na marafiki.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.393
Saaa hii ni kama mtandao

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:47.673
unaoniunganisha na watu wengine

00:00:47.697 --> 00:00:49.896
wanaopanga kuokoa dunia.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.957
Wajua nilianzaje ?

00:00:52.981 --> 00:00:54.885
Ni baba na busara zake.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:59.537
Kila kitu ulimfunza, 
alienda akafunza ulimwengu.

00:00:59.561 --> 00:01:04.450
Maneno yake yote 
kuhusu uwajibikaji tulionao kama binadamu